<h2>🇺🇸 Shipping Within the United States</h2>
<ul>
<li>
<p><strong>Estimated Delivery Time:</strong><br><strong>7–21 business days</strong> (excluding order processing time)</p>
</li>
<li>
<p>Please note that delivery times may vary due to:</p>
<ul>
